{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13d5_level_act13d5_03_end","groupId":"act13d5","stageId":"act13d5_03","title":"玫瑰报业","storyCode":"MN-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"5edf3472b0f5b550e27bb20f59b21205f19073fd0dddaf91a64d27f5188caa6a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔 3下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"玛莉娅。\n玛莉娅，你有一双天马的眼睛。\n玛莉娅，站起来，来，过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......！居然躲开了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"那好吧，就让你的右手在你的身上多呆一会......反正就一小会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（——不是眼泪，黏糊糊的，是血？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（......好多血......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（心跳好快......我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"滑稽，真滑稽，你挥舞武器的样子就像大骑士团门前的那些弄臣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"除了外貌，你有哪点像那个耀骑士了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我是不会输的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，这样我更乐意撕碎你那张脸了，不识好歹的贵族妞！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉！风暴般的追击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"这是本次赛事以来，呼啸竞技场最夸张的一次损毁——！赛场屠夫英格拉！“锈铜”英格拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"就在一个月前，“锈铜”英格拉在本赛季的首秀就将“焚风”骑士殴打致四肢粉碎性骨折才肯罢休！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，是殴打！这绝非手持武器的骑士行径！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，在呼啸竞技场备受瞩目的玛莉娅·临光，是否也难逃“锈铜”残暴的利斧？观众们，告诉我你们的态度！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这样！“锈铜”英格拉！让你的对手血溅当场吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（好重——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅！投降吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是输掉一场比赛而已！积分还是有机会的——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"佐菲娅姑母......在说什么？\n听不清......头好晕......盾也好重......\n我......在做什么......骑士竞技......我在赛场上......\n快......睁开眼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊......呼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！不错的反击——这才有撕裂你的意义！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"那么快就完蛋可没意思了，我要用你的血，涂满你那张让人火大的脸......耀骑士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明......也快到极限了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，这点血也能叫伤！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......英格拉提前出战了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"国民院提前释放了他，嘁，这审判根本就形同虚设。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"看来集团为他掏了不少钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼......玫瑰报业联合集团有的是钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"还真让人火大，人渣和舆论反倒能带来利润，那个解说甚至敢在公开赛事拿这茬说事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他们不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，怕啥呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"怕我们，英格拉不喜欢失败，而我会让他一败涂地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"别呀，说好的让我上呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不过在那之前......如果小临光还不想想办法，她会伤得很重的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——血肉横飞的场景迟迟没有到来！玛莉娅·临光，比想象中还要顽强的少女！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"还在等什么，难道这样的骑士不让人心生敬仰吗！？别忘了！本赛季的敬仰手续费只需要百分之五十！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等！情况又有变化！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"对峙着的二人——玛莉娅竟然舍弃了盾牌！发生了什么！？难道她想靠那把脆弱的单手剑接下英格拉的巨斧！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"巨大的体格差，巨大的力量差，只是靠着灵活的身手勉强躲避的玛莉娅，终于准备正面对决了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"容我再强调一遍——！本赛季的手续费只有一半！这样勇敢的行径难道不值几十枚金币吗！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......做的，还不赖，你这小妞......淡淡的光覆盖在剑刃上，这是你最后的手段吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，好啊！我会撕下你的手臂，然后用你的血肉塞住你的喉咙——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"必须获胜......必须......\n我在做什么来着......骑士竞技，需要杀死对手吗？\n盾，不需要......我挡不住他的重斧......\n但他也受伤了，他不在乎......他像个怪物，他杀伐取乐......\n我......该怎么面对这样的敌人......敌人？他不是骑士吗？\n骑士......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac13_4"},{"type":"narration","text":"“所谓骑士，就是照亮整片大地的崇高者。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"疼、疼疼疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姑母......？我怎么......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......我输了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是英格拉也倒下了，你们两个人的积分都没有变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是这样，呼......那就好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根本就不好！你受了伤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面对那样的对手，你应该弃权的，玛莉娅，只是放弃一场比赛，积分还可以再想办法追回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是想要赢得封号保住贵族之名，何必要这么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我没想过要弃权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然万幸没有伤筋动骨......对手是英格拉还能全身而退，真的算你运气好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你再受伤，就算能够进入特锦赛又怎么样！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......他很厉害，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很不像骑士。他的家族本来就家大业大，参赛也只是来享受施暴乐趣的，奥尔默·英格拉就是这样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅，你如果再受这样的伤，我不允许你继续参赛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听姐姐的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别乱动，好好休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然是平手，但是接下来找到你的企业合作会越来越多......我和马丁叔会暂时帮你谢绝一些，你必须安心养伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......那把剑是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我以前的佩剑。上次训练的时候把它翻出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么佐菲娅姐姐要特地带着这把剑......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（姑母明明已经......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么特别的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是万一英格拉真的对你做了些什么，哪怕事后要面对国民院，我也会亲手杀了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不用考虑到这一步啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......能给我看看吗？好像已经很久没用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，好好休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"光待在床上会生锈的啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"佐菲娅姐姐，姑母，就这一个要求，我会乖乖待在家里休息的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......唉，越来越像你姐姐了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你吧，别对它做什么奇怪的事情，我还是挺爱惜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......这不是挺多灰的嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"落灰才是爱惜的证明！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"你们大包小包的是要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"去探望一下玛莉娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉那个混蛋，对丫头下那么重的手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒觉得你们别去打扰她们比较好，佐菲娅会照顾好玛莉娅的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"我坐不住啊！你看到英格拉最后那一斧子了吗？万一留下什么后遗症可咋整？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"一个老骑士和一个老工匠，总是能帮上忙的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"那遇上玛恩纳怎么办？就不怕他一手一个把你们拎出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......那臭小子，临光老爷在的时候哪敢这么放肆，打不过还躲不起吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔，那两个老头刚走就有新客人了，看来他俩是我的煞星啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们酒吧可好久没来过这么可爱的客人了啊，需要点什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......这名字挺好听的，就这个吧，“荆棘泪珠”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_204_platnm","aliases":["白金"]}]}
